          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: विरोध करणे",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "विरोध करणे — virodh karṇe — \"to oppose\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लोकांनी नव्या रस्त्याला विरोध केला. lokānnī navyā rastyālā virodh kelā. People opposed the new road."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने विरोध केला, tyāne virodh kelā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is opposed takes -ला: रस्त्याला विरोध करणे (virodh karṇe)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "विरोध करणे (virodh karṇe) joins the tatsama विरोध, Sanskrit virodha, \"opposition, hindrance\" (Monier-Williams), to करणे, \"to do\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
