              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पाठिंबा देणे — pāṭhimbā deṇe — \"to support; to back\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "माझ्या मित्रांनी मला पूर्ण पाठिंबा दिला. mājhyā mitrānnī malā pūrṇa pāṭhimbā dilā. My friends gave me full support."
