              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने पाठिंबा दिला, tyāne pāṭhimbā dilā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The person backed takes -ला: मला पाठिंबा दिला."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पाठिंबा देणे (pāṭhimbā deṇe) joins पाठिंबा, \"backing\", a Marathi noun whose origin is not settled, to देणे, \"to give\"."
